Hi,

you must add in your HTML head this:
<script type="text/javascript" charset="utf8" src="//cdn.datatables.net/1.10.3/js/jquery.dataTables.js <http://cdn.datatables.net/1.10.3/js/jquery.dataTables.js>"></script>
and
<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="//cdn.datatables.net/1.10.3/css/jquery.dataTables.css <http://cdn.datatables.net/1.10.3/css/jquery.dataTables.css>">

Place the script AFTER JQuery initialization.

It works ;-)

Cheers,

Andrea

