Hi,

I have a section in server.R that goes as:

output$downloadReport <- downloadHandler(
    filename = function() {
      paste(createOutput()$info$outputFile, ".pdf", sep = "")

    },
    content = function(file) {
          x <- createOutput()
          brewPDF(x, file, session)
    }
  )

The brew command takes a while -- so when you click the button, a new window opens. You then stare at a blank window for about 15 seconds until the pdf file is ready. Is there a way to get it to stay on the original window until the brew/latex/etc completes?

Thanks,
Greg

